{
  "net": "net-team-po",
  "model": "agenticnets-product",
  "session": "team",
  "description": "The product owner. An iteration trigger (from the app or an allocation by the product office) becomes a brief with the measured state of the module; the product owner proposes the next requirement as a choice, an interview or asks for the team goal; the person answers in the app; the answer becomes a requirement under a contract that goes to the architect.",
  "places": {
    "p-team-charter": "The team charter",
    "p-team-iterate": "Iteration triggers (the app, or the product office's allocation)",
    "p-team-po-cmd": "Product owner commands",
    "p-team-po-log": "Product owner command results",
    "p-team-context": "Briefs for the one-shot lanes",
    "p-team-state": "The measured state of the module (structure, tests, health, debt)",
    "p-team-prompts": "Questions for the person",
    "p-team-responses": "The person's answers",
    "p-team-requirements": "Requirements",
    "p-team-requirement-drafts": "Requirements on their way to the architect",
    "p-team-ideas": "Ideas from the person and the brain",
    "p-team-llm-errors": "Answers that missed their contract",
    "p-team-journal": "What every lane did",
    "p-team-errors": "Script errors",
    "p-product-inbox": "Product office inbox",
    "p-team-prompt-new": "A copy of every new question, consumed by the mirror step that tells the product office"
  },
  "transitions": [
    {
      "id": "t-team-iterate-prep",
      "kind": "map",
      "label": "Iteration trigger to proposal brief",
      "reads": {
        "it": {
          "place": "p-team-iterate",
          "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1"
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "cmd": "p-team-po-cmd"
      },
      "template": {
        "kind": "command",
        "id": "brief-${now()}",
        "executor": "script",
        "command": "invoke",
        "expect": "text",
        "stage": "brief",
        "filedAt": "${now()}",
        "args": {
          "toolId": "team-po",
          "argv": [
            "brief",
            "${it.data.iterationId}",
            "p-team-charter"
          ],
          "env": {
            "MODEL_ID": "agenticnets-product",
            "DIRECTION": "${it.data.direction}",
            "DIRECTION_NOTES": "${it.data.notes}",
            "ROADMAP_ID": "${it.data.roadmapId}"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 900000
        },
        "iterationId": "${it.data.iterationId}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-po-cmd",
      "kind": "command",
      "label": "Product owner process",
      "description": "team-po: state (the coding agent describes the module read-only), brief (proposal), requirement-brief (after the answer).",
      "reads": {
        "input": {
          "place": "p-team-po-cmd",
          "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1"
        },
        "ideas": {
          "place": "p-team-ideas",
          "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.status == \"open\" LIMIT 1",
          "consume": false,
          "optional": true
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "log": {
          "place": "p-team-po-log",
          "retain": 200
        },
        "context": "p-team-context",
        "state": {
          "place": "p-team-state",
          "retain": 10
        },
        "responses": "p-team-responses",
        "office_inbox": "p-product-inbox",
        "journal": "p-team-journal",
        "errors": "p-team-errors",
        "prompts": "p-team-prompts",
        "po_cmd": "p-team-po-cmd",
        "charter": "p-team-charter"
      },
      "emit": [
        {
          "from": "@result",
          "to": "log"
        }
      ],
      "command": {
        "timeoutMs": 900000
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-propose",
      "kind": "agent",
      "label": "Propose the next requirement",
      "reads": {
        "ctx": {
          "place": "p-team-context",
          "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.purpose == \"propose\" LIMIT 1",
          "ttl": 900000
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "out": "p-team-prompts",
        "errors": {
          "place": "p-team-llm-errors",
          "retain": 100
        },
        "new": "p-team-prompt-new"
      },
      "agent": {
        "role": "r",
        "tier": "medium",
        "maxIterations": 1,
        "oneShot": true,
        "autoEmit": true,
        "allowedTools": [],
        "answerSchema": {
          "required": [
            "promptId",
            "iterationId",
            "mode",
            "question",
            "options",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "types": {
            "options": "array",
            "question": "string",
            "mode": "string",
            "rationale": "string"
          },
          "retries": 1
        },
        "nl": "You are the PRODUCT OWNER of the ${ctx.data.service} service in the product described in the brief, deciding with the person what the service needs next. Read the brief, then reply with ONE JSON object and nothing else.\n\n${ctx.data.brief}\n\nChoose the mode:\n- \"goal\" when the brief says the TEAM GOAL is NOT DEFINED and no direction from the product office is given: ask the person what this service must become; give 3 example goals they can adapt.\n- \"interview\" when the next requirement cannot be chosen without information only the person has: at most 3 precise questions as options {value: \"q1\", label: <question>, description: <why it matters>}.\n- \"choice\" otherwise: propose 3 or 4 concrete requirements for this service, each ONE bounded change a developer can implement in one run with a spec and acceptance criteria. Follow the office's DIRECTION when the brief carries one; prefer a red audit, a failed verification, an open bug, an open idea naming this service, then the goal's most valuable gap. Every option: {value: \"opt-1\", label: <one line>, description: <what and why, two sentences>, kind: \"feature|bug|docs|tests|refactor|readiness\", module: <the code path from THE MODULE STATE it touches>, effort: \"S|M|L\", risk: \"low|medium|high\", evidence: [<lines from the brief>], recommended: true|false}. Exactly one is recommended.\n\nAlways: promptId and iterationId exactly as the brief says; question is one sentence; rationale is 3 sentences on what the brief showed."
      },
      "emit": [
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "out",
          "when": "mode == 'choice' OR mode == 'interview' OR mode == 'goal'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "new",
          "when": "mode == 'choice' OR mode == 'interview' OR mode == 'goal'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "errors",
          "when": "mode != 'choice' AND mode != 'interview' AND mode != 'goal'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "errors",
          "when": "error"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-prompt-prep",
      "kind": "map",
      "label": "New question to the office inbox",
      "reads": {
        "q": {
          "place": "p-team-prompt-new",
          "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1"
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "cmd": "p-team-po-cmd"
      },
      "template": {
        "kind": "command",
        "id": "mirror-${now()}",
        "executor": "script",
        "command": "invoke",
        "expect": "text",
        "stage": "mirror",
        "promptId": "${q.data.promptId}",
        "filedAt": "${now()}",
        "args": {
          "toolId": "team-po",
          "argv": [
            "mirror",
            "${q.data.promptId}",
            "p-team-charter"
          ],
          "env": {
            "MODEL_ID": "agenticnets-product"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-answer-prep",
      "kind": "map",
      "label": "Answer to requirement brief",
      "reads": {
        "resp": {
          "place": "p-team-responses",
          "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.intent == \"answer\" LIMIT 1"
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "cmd": "p-team-po-cmd"
      },
      "template": {
        "kind": "command",
        "id": "requirement-brief-${now()}",
        "executor": "script",
        "command": "invoke",
        "expect": "text",
        "stage": "requirement-brief",
        "filedAt": "${now()}",
        "args": {
          "toolId": "team-po",
          "argv": [
            "requirement-brief",
            "${resp.data.iterationId}",
            "${resp.data.promptId}",
            "p-team-charter"
          ],
          "env": {
            "MODEL_ID": "agenticnets-product",
            "RESPONSE_SELECTED": "${resp.data.selected}",
            "RESPONSE_TEXT": "${resp.data.text}",
            "RESPONSE_NOTES": "${resp.data.notes}"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 300000
        },
        "iterationId": "${resp.data.iterationId}",
        "promptId": "${resp.data.promptId}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-revise-prep",
      "kind": "map",
      "label": "Reshaped question to a new brief",
      "reads": {
        "resp": {
          "place": "p-team-responses",
          "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.intent == \"revise\" LIMIT 1"
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "cmd": "p-team-po-cmd"
      },
      "template": {
        "kind": "command",
        "id": "brief-${now()}",
        "executor": "script",
        "command": "invoke",
        "expect": "text",
        "stage": "brief",
        "filedAt": "${now()}",
        "args": {
          "toolId": "team-po",
          "argv": [
            "brief",
            "${resp.data.iterationId}",
            "p-team-charter"
          ],
          "env": {
            "MODEL_ID": "agenticnets-product",
            "REVISION_TEXT": "${resp.data.text}"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 900000
        },
        "iterationId": "${resp.data.iterationId}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t-team-requirement",
      "kind": "agent",
      "label": "Write the requirement",
      "reads": {
        "ctx": {
          "place": "p-team-context",
          "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.purpose == \"requirement\" LIMIT 1",
          "ttl": 900000
        }
      },
      "writes": {
        "out": "p-team-requirements",
        "drafts": "p-team-requirement-drafts",
        "errors": {
          "place": "p-team-llm-errors",
          "retain": 100
        }
      },
      "agent": {
        "role": "r",
        "tier": "medium",
        "maxIterations": 1,
        "oneShot": true,
        "autoEmit": true,
        "allowedTools": [],
        "answerSchema": {
          "required": [
            "requirementId",
            "iterationId",
            "promptId",
            "kind",
            "title",
            "story",
            "summary",
            "module",
            "scope",
            "done",
            "priority",
            "status"
          ],
          "types": {
            "scope": "array",
            "outOfScope": "array",
            "done": "array",
            "risks": "array"
          },
          "retries": 1
        },
        "nl": "You are the PRODUCT OWNER of the ${ctx.data.service} service writing the requirement the person chose. Read the brief, then reply with ONE JSON object and nothing else.\n\n${ctx.data.brief}\n\nReply EXACTLY: {\"requirementId\": <from the brief>, \"iterationId\": <from the brief>, \"promptId\": <from the brief>, \"kind\": \"feature|bug|docs|tests|refactor|readiness\", \"title\": <one line>, \"story\": <as a user of this service I want ... so that ...>, \"summary\": <three sentences>, \"module\": <the code path it touches, from THE MODULE STATE>, \"scope\": [<what is in>], \"outOfScope\": [<what is not>], \"done\": [<observable conditions of done, each measurable by QA>], \"risks\": [<risks>], \"priority\": \"high|medium|low\", \"status\": \"draft\"}. Rules: one bounded change; done conditions are measurable (a test, an endpoint answering, a log line, a document present); never widen beyond the person's choice."
      },
      "emit": [
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "out",
          "when": "status == 'draft'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "drafts",
          "when": "status == 'draft'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "errors",
          "when": "status != 'draft'"
        },
        {
          "from": "@response",
          "to": "errors",
          "when": "error"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
